{"id":"n38803-2-2","stage":5,"title":"기어코 · 最终","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38803-2-2-1","ko":"아까 언니와 말다툼을 좀 했어.","zh":"刚才我和姐姐吵了一架。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언니와","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말다툼을","meaning":"吵架，吵嘴","explanation":"말다툼：吵架，吵嘴；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말다툼","audio":"/audio/29e49d135f613ce4675e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51702","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다툼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"29e49d135f613ce4","term":"말다툼","zh":"吵架，吵嘴","audio":"/audio/29e49d135f613ce4675e.mp3","entryId":"51702","definition":"为争辩对错而用言语争吵的行为。","pronunciation":["말ː다툼"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b11b243609c69e04fd24.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38803-2-2-2","ko":"아침부터 분위기가 예사롭지 않더니 기어코 싸운 모양이구나.","zh":"从早上开始气氛就不对劲，看来最终还是吵架了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침부터","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"2","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예사롭지","meaning":"寻常，平常","explanation":"예사롭다：寻常，平常；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"예사롭다","audio":"/audio/c29c054a23ff53249841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71151","senseId":"2","lemma":"예사롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않더니","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기어코","meaning":"最终，终于","explanation":"기어코：最终，终于","readings":[{"term":"기어코","audio":"/audio/89f9852937964039dc42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38803","senseId":"2","lemma":"기어코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸운","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이구나.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"周围的状况或环境。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"c29c054a23ff5324","term":"예사롭다","zh":"寻常，平常","audio":"/audio/c29c054a23ff53249841.mp3","entryId":"71151","definition":"与平时没有不同。","pronunciation":["예ː사롭따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"89f9852937964039","term":"기어코","zh":"最终，终于","audio":"/audio/89f9852937964039dc42.mp3","entryId":"38803","definition":"到最后。","pronunciation":["기어코"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b47c393d4d861335f03.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38803","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从早上开始气氛就不对劲，看来最终还是吵架了啊。","刚才我和姐姐吵了一架。","手是怎么受伤的？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["刚才我和姐姐吵了一架。","手是怎么受伤的？","从早上开始气氛就不对劲，看来最终还是吵架了啊。"],"answer":2}]}
